ce":"கொள்ளாது","parts":[{"text":"கொள்ளாது","lemma":"koḷ","gloss":"without receiving"}],"gloss":"without receiving"},{"surface":"அமையலென்","parts":[{"text":"அமையலென்","lemma":"amai","gloss":"I will not remain"}],"gloss":"I will not remain"},{"surface":"அடுக்கிய","parts":[{"text":"அடுக்கிய","lemma":"aṭukku","gloss":"piled up"}],"gloss":"piled up"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பண்","parts":[{"text":"பண்","lemma":"paṇ","gloss":"melody"}],"gloss":"melody"},{"surface":"அமை","parts":[{"text":"அமை","lemma":"amai","gloss":"fitted"}],"gloss":"fitted"},{"surface":"நரம்பின்","parts":[{"text":"நரம்பு","lemma":"narampu","gloss":"string"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the strings"},{"surface":"பச்சை","parts":[{"text":"பச்சை","lemma":"paccai","gloss":"fresh"}],"gloss":"fresh"},{"surface":"நல்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"good"},{"surface":"யாழ்","parts":[{"text":"யாழ்","lemma":"yāḻ","gloss":"lute"}],"gloss":"lute"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மண்","parts":[{"text":"மண்","lemma":"maṇ","gloss":"clay"}],"gloss":"clay"},{"surface":"அமை","parts":[{"text":"அமை","lemma":"amai","gloss":"fitted"}],"gloss":"fitted"},{"surface":"முழவின்","parts":[{"text":"முழவு","lemma":"muḻavu","gloss":"drum"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the drum"},{"surface":"வயிரியர்","parts":[{"text":"வயிரியர்","lemma":"vayiriyar","gloss":"bards"}],"gloss":"bards"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்மை","parts":[{"text":"இன்மை","lemma":"iṉmai","gloss":"poverty"}],"gloss":"poverty"},{"surface":"தீர்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"தீர்க்கும்","lemma":"tīr","gloss":"resolving"}],"gloss":"resolving"},{"surface":"குடி","parts":[{"text":"குடி","lemma":"kuṭi","gloss":"lineage"}],"gloss":"lineage"},{"surface":"பிறந்தோயே","parts":[{"text":"பிறந்தோயே","lemma":"பிறந்தோயே","gloss":"O you who were born"}],"gloss":"O you who were born","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Cooking greatly forgotten, on the high-edged hearth / mushrooms blooming, suffering from wasting hunger, / due to the absence of milk, shriveled with the skin, / the nipple-pores closed up, the bad empty breasts / whenever he sucks, crying, looking at her child's state, / with water filled, wet-lidded, cool-eyed, my / wife's distress looking at and thinking of, / I came seeking you, O Kumanan of good warfare! / If you have understood my state, in this state, / even without playing music, I cannot remain without receiving; piled up / melody-tuned strings of the fresh good lute, / and clay-tuned drum, of the bards / poverty-removing lineage, O you who were born in it!","translation":"On the high-edged hearth where cooking has long been forgotten, mushrooms sprout. Suffering from wasting hunger, because there is no milk, the nipple-pores are closed and the breasts are shriveled and empty. Whenever the child sucks, he cries. Looking at her child's state, my wife's cool eyes, with wet eyelids, are filled with tears. Beholding her distress and thinking upon it, I came seeking you, O Kumanan of victorious warfare! If you have understood my state, I cannot remain now without receiving your bounty, even without playing my lute. O one born of the noble lineage that dispels the poverty of bards who play the fresh, good lute with melody-tuned strings and the clay-tuned drum!","modern":"சமைத்தலை முற்றிலும் மறந்த, உயர்ந்த பக்கங்களைக் கொண்ட அடுப்பில் காளான்கள் முளைத்துள்ளன. வாட்டும் பசியால் வருந்தி, பால் இல்லாததால் தோல் சுருங்கி, துளைகள் அடைபட்ட வறிய மார்பகங்களைச் சுவைக்கும் போதெல்லாம் அழுகின்ற தன் குழந்தையின் நிலையைப் பார்த்து, கண்ணீரால் நிறைந்த குளிர்ந்த கண்களைக் கொண்ட என் மனைவியின் துயரத்தைக் கண்டு வருந்தி, நல்ல போர்த்திறன் கொண்ட குமணனே, உன்னை நாடி வந்தேன். என் வறுமை நிலையை நீ அறிந்துகொண்டால், இசையைத் தொடுத்துப் பாடாமலேயே உன்னிடமிருந்து பரிசில் பெறாமல் என்னால் இருக்க முடியாது. பண் அமைந்த நரம்புகளைக் கொண்ட புதிய யாழையும், மண் பூசப்பட்ட முழவையும் வாசிக்கும் பாணர்களின் வறுமையைப் போக்கும் சிறந்த குடியில் பிறந்தவனே!","explanation":"The poet Peruntalaiccāttaṉār addresses the generous patron Kumaṇaṉ, describing the extreme poverty of his household to seek patronage. He paints a vivid picture of domestic misery where cooking has been forgotten for so long that mushrooms sprout on the high-edged hearth. His wife suffers from wasting hunger, and because she has no milk, her breasts are shriveled and her nipple-pores are closed. Whenever their infant child tries to suckle, he cries in frustration, and the mother looks at her child with eyes filled with tears. Seeing his wife's deep distress, the poet has come seeking Kumaṇaṉ, stating that if the patron understands this dire state, the poet cannot leave without receiving bounty, even without performing. He praises Kumaṇaṉ as one born of a noble lineage that always dispels the poverty of bards who play the lute and drum.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.8],[1.8,2.2],[2.2,2.7],[2.7,3.08],[3.08,3.5],[3.5,3.9],[3.9,4.1],[4.1,5.7],[5.7,5.7],[5.7,6.2],[6.2,7.1],[7.1,7.2],[7.2,7.6],[7.6,8.3],[8.3,9.3],[9.53,10.2],[10.2,10.7],[10.7,11.0],[11.0,11.68],[11.9,12.5],[12.5,13.0],[13.0,13.5],[13.5,14.6],[14.6,14.7],[14.7,15.0],[15.0,15.3],[15.3,16.34],[16.34,16.34],[16.34,17.38],[17.38,17.95],[18.8,19.3],[19.3,20.0],[20.0,20.2],[20.2,21.2],[21.2,22.1],[22.1,22.1],[22.1,22.1],[22.1,23.6],[23.6,24.7],[24.7,24.7],[24.7,25.4],[25.4,25.6],[25.6,25.8],[25.8,27.0],[27.0,27.1],[27.1,28.3],[28.3,28.6],[28.6,29.18],[29.18,29.29]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.0],[1.0,1.9],[1.9,2.3],[2.3,2.7],[2.7,3.08],[3.08,3.5],[3.5,4.63],[4.63,5.2],[5.2,5.7],[5.7,5.7],[5.7,6.3],[6.3,7.3],[7.3,7.4],[7.4,7.8],[7.91,8.6],[8.6,8.6],[8.6,10.6],[10.6,11.2],[11.2,11.5],[11.5,12.7],[12.7,12.7],[12.7,13.6],[13.6,14.0],[14.0,15.0],[15.0,15.1],[15.1,15.5],[15.5,15.8],[15.8,16.1],[16.1,16.4],[16.4,16.7],[16.7,17.0],[19.84,20.44],[20.44,20.94],[20.94,21.24],[21.24,22.15],[22.15,23.14],[23.14,23.14],[23.14,23.14],[23.14,24.64],[24.64,25.54],[25.54,25.64],[25.64,26.34],[26.34,26.54],[26.54,26.78],[26.78,28.24],[28.